        // LegalDocumentsDialog.kt
        "1. Scope & Data Controller (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Reikwijdte & verwerkingsverantwoordelijke (Bijgewerkt: november 2026)",
        "This Privacy Policy explains how Finsay (finsayapp.com, package com.kynigos.oikonomos) collects, uses, processes, stores, and protects your personal and financial tracking data. It is designed to comply with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR 2016/679), Greek Law 4624/2019, the UK GDPR, applicable United States privacy statutes (including the California CCPA/CPRA, Virginia VCDPA, Colorado CPA, Connecticut CTDPA, and Texas TDPSA), and Google Play Developer Program Policies. Data Controller contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "Dit Privacybeleid legt uit hoe Finsay (finsayapp.com, pakket com.kynigos.oikonomos) jouw persoons- en financiële gegevens verwerkt en beschermt conform de EU AVG/GDPR (2016/679), Griekse Wet 4624/2019, UK GDPR, Amerikaanse privacywetten (CCPA/CPRA enz.) en Google Play-beleid. Contact: support@finsayapp.com.",
        "2. Categories of Data Collected & Profile Isolation" to "2. Verzamelde gegevens & profielisolatie",
        "• Account & Authentication Data: Name, email address, unique user identifier (UID), and profile photo obtained via Google Sign-In (Android Credential Manager) or Email/Password through Firebase Authentication.\n• Private Profile Details (Strictly Owner-Only): Optional fields such as phone number, date of birth, occupation, and city are isolated in a private sub-document readable and writable exclusively by your authenticated account—never exposed to other users during ledger-sharing lookups.\n• Financial & Budget Records: Amounts, titles/descriptions, categories, dates, payment sources, selected ledger currency, incomes, monthly budgets, recurring bills, savings goals, and member split/settle-up entries voluntarily logged by you.\n• Shared Household Data: Member nicknames, roles (Creator, Editor, Registar), shared ledger links, and an activity log of ledger edits visible to authorized members of that ledger.\n• Preferences & Local Settings: Language (EL/EN), theme mode, reminder schedules, and local merchant-to-category memory." to "• Account & inloggen: naam, e-mail, UID en foto via Google Sign-In of e-mail/wachtwoord (Firebase Authentication).\n• Privéprofiel (alleen eigenaar): telefoon, geboortedatum, beroep en woonplaats staan geïsoleerd in een privédocument, nooit zichtbaar voor anderen.\n• Financiële gegevens: bedragen, titels, categorieën, datums, valuta, inkomsten, budgetten, vaste lasten, doelen en verdelingen.\n• Gedeelde boeken: bijnamen, rollen (Maker, Redacteur, Invoerder), deellinks en logboek voor gemachtigde leden.\n• Lokale voorkeuren: taal, thema, herinneringen en lokaal winkelgeheugen.",
        "3. Bank & Wallet Push Notification Reader (Optional, 100% On-Device)" to "3. Bankmelding-lezer (Optioneel, 100% lokaal)",
        "• Strictly Opt-In: The Bank Notification Auto-Catcher (Android NotificationListenerService) is completely disabled by default. It activates ONLY after you review our in-app Prominent Disclosure and manually grant Notification Access in Android System Settings.\n• Strict Filtering & On-Device Parsing: Finsay filters solely for recognized banking and digital wallet notification packages (ignoring personal messages, chats, emails, and OTP/2FA codes). Merchant name and transaction amount are parsed 100% locally in device memory.\n• Zero Transmission & Explicit Save: Raw notification text is NEVER uploaded to Finsay servers, logged externally, or shared with third parties. Detected alerts create a local draft only; an expense is saved and synced to the cloud ONLY if you actively tap Save/Confirm.\n• No Bank Credentials / No Open Banking: Finsay never collects banking logins, passwords, card numbers, PINs, or PSD2/Open Banking tokens.\n• Revocation: You may disable this feature anytime in App Settings or Android System Settings." to "• Strikt opt-in: staat standaard uit en werkt pas na jouw handmatige toestemming in Android-instellingen.\n• Strikte filtering lokaal: leest enkel meldingen van ondersteunde banken/wallets (negeert berichten, sms, e-mails en OTP-codes) op het apparaat.\n• Geen verzending: tekst wordt nooit geüpload of gedeeld; maakt enkel een lokaal concept dat pas na jouw bevestiging wordt opgeslagen.\n• Geen bankinloggegevens: nooit wachtwoorden, kaartnummers, pincodes of PSD2-tokens.\n• Intrekken: altijd uit te schakelen.",
        "4. Camera, Receipt OCR, AADE/e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. Camera, bonnen-OCR, AADE QR & spraakinvoer",
        "• Camera & Photo Picker: Camera access (CAMERA) or the zero-permission Android Photo Picker is used solely when you choose to scan a receipt or QR code. OCR text recognition and barcode decoding run locally on-device via Google ML Kit; receipt images are not uploaded to Finsay servers.\n• Greek AADE / e-Invoicing QR Verification: When you scan a Greek tax/e-invoicing QR code, the app may perform a direct, read-only HTTPS lookup strictly to allowlisted official tax/e-invoicing domains (e.g., aade.gr and certified Greek e-invoicing providers) solely to retrieve merchant name, VAT/AFM, date, and total amount.\n• Voice Expense Entry (RECORD_AUDIO): Used only when you press the microphone button. Speech-to-text relies on Android's native SpeechRecognizer service (subject to your device/Google speech service terms), and the resulting text is parsed locally into a draft expense. Finsay does NOT record, save, or upload audio files." to "• Camera & fotokiezer: enkel bij scannen van bonnen of QR. OCR draait lokaal via Google ML Kit; geen foto's worden geüpload.\n• Griekse AADE QR: bij Griekse fiscale QR-codes kan de app alleen-lezen officiële domeinen (zoals aade.gr) opvragen.\n• Spraak (RECORD_AUDIO): enkel bij indrukken microfoon via Android SpeechRecognizer. Geen audio wordt opgeslagen of geüpload.",
        "5. Biometric App Lock, Local Merchant Memory & Device Features" to "5. Biometrisch slot, lokaal geheugen & apparaatfuncties",
        "• Optional Biometric & PIN App Lock: Fingerprint/Face Unlock uses Android BiometricPrompt handled exclusively by your device's secure OS hardware. Finsay NEVER accesses, collects, stores, or transmits biometric identifiers or templates (compliant with GDPR Art. 9 and US state biometric laws such as BIPA/CUBI). Any optional 4-digit PIN is stored strictly on-device as a salted SHA-256 hash.\n• Smart Merchant Category Memory: Category corrections for merchants/VAT IDs are stored locally on-device (SharedPreferences) solely to improve auto-suggestions.\n• Reminders, Widgets, Quick Tile & App Shortcuts: Local notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS, RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED, WAKE_LOCK, VIBRATE) deliver user-configured reminders and bank-draft prompts. Widgets, Quick Settings tiles, and launcher App Shortcuts operate locally." to "• Biometrie & PIN: via Android BiometricPrompt. Finsay verzamelt of bewaart geen biometrische gegevens; optionele pincode wordt lokaal als gezouten SHA-256-hash opgeslagen.\n• Winkelgeheugen: categoriecorrecties blijven enkel op het toestel.\n• Herinneringen, widgets & tegels: werken volledig lokaal.",
        "6. Legal Bases (GDPR / UK GDPR), Zero Ads & No Data Selling" to "6. Rechtsgronden (AVG), geen reclame & geen gegevensverkoop",
        "• Performance of Contract (Art. 6(1)(b)): Delivering budgeting, multi-currency tracking, analytics, cloud sync, shared ledgers, and data exports.\n• Consent (Art. 6(1)(a)): Mandatory acceptance of these Terms & Privacy Policy (version and timestamp recorded in your private owner-only profile), plus optional bank notification parsing, camera/OCR, microphone voice input, and reminder notifications (withdrawable anytime).\n• Legitimate Interests (Art. 6(1)(f)): Ensuring security, preventing unauthorized access via Firebase Authentication and Zero-Trust Firestore Security Rules, and maintaining service reliability.\n• Zero Ads, No Data Brokers & No Third-Party AI Uploads: Finsay displays no ads, does NOT sell or rent personal data, does NOT share personal data for cross-context behavioral advertising, and does NOT transmit your financial data to third-party cloud LLM/AI services." to "• Uitvoering overeenkomst (Art. 6.1.b): budgetten, multivaluta, statistieken, cloud-sync, delen en exports.\n• Toestemming (Art. 6.1.a): akkoord op Voorwaarden/Privacy en optionele functies (banklezer, OCR, spraak, meldingen), altijd intrekbaar.\n• Gerechtvaardigd belang (Art. 6.1.f): beveiliging, Zero-Trust Firestore-regels en betrouwbaarheid.\n• Geen advertenties: Finsay toont geen reclame, verkoopt geen gegevens en stuurt ze niet naar externe AI.",
        "7. Cloud Infrastructure, Security & International Transfers" to "7. Cloudinfrastructuur, beveiliging & doorgifte",
        "• Crash & Performance Diagnostics: Finsay uses Firebase Crashlytics and Firebase Performance Monitoring solely to detect crashes and improve app responsiveness. Only anonymous technical diagnostics (device model, OS version, stack traces, and app startup/sync timings) are collected—never financial entries, amounts, emails, or personal identifiers." to "• Crash- en prestatiediagnostiek: Finsay gebruikt Firebase Crashlytics en Firebase Performance Monitoring uitsluitend om crashes op te sporen en de snelheid te verbeteren. Alleen anonieme technische gegevens (apparaatmodel, Android-versie, stacktraces en laadtijden) worden verzameld — nooit financiële gegevens, bedragen, e-mails of persoonlijke identificatiegegevens.",
        "• Storage & Security: Cloud data is hosted on Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore with TLS encryption in transit, AES encryption at rest, Firebase Authentication, and Zero-Trust Security Rules restricting reads/writes to authorized ledger members.\n• International Data Transfers: Because Google Cloud / Firebase operates global infrastructure (including EU and US servers), any transfers outside the EEA or UK are safeguarded by EU Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs), the UK International Data Transfer Addendum, and Google LLC's certification under the EU-US / UK-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play Services: Finsay Pro purchases are processed exclusively by Google Play Billing (we never see or store payment card details). Native Google Play In-App Updates and In-App Review APIs may run discreetly under Google's Privacy Policy." to "• Beveiliging: gehost op Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore met TLS- en AES-versleuteling en Zero-Trust-regels.\n• Internationale doorgifte: beschermd door EU-standaardcontractbepalingen (SCC) en het EU-VS Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play: Pro-aankopen verlopen uitsluitend via Google Play Billing; wij zien nooit betaalkaartgegevens.",
        "8. Data Retention, Exports & Permanent Account Deletion" to "8. Bewaartermijn, exports & account verwijderen",
        "• Retention: We retain your account and ledger data only for as long as your account remains active or until you delete specific entries or your entire account.\n• Data Portability: You may export your expenses, incomes, balances, and member settle-up summaries to Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf), or CSV (.csv) locally on-device anytime.\n• Immediate Account Deletion: You may permanently delete your account, private profile, owned ledgers, and cloud/local data directly in the app (Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account) or via https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html. Residual cloud backups are purged within standard infrastructure cycles (up to 30 days)." to "• Bewaartermijn: zolang je account actief is of totdat je gegevens wist.\n• Dataportabiliteit: exporteer op elk moment naar Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf) of CSV (.csv).\n• Direct verwijderen: via Menu (☰) > Profiel > Account verwijderen of https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html (restback-ups gewist binnen 30 dagen).",
        "9. Your Rights (Greece, EU/EEA, UK & United States)" to "9. Jouw rechten (EU/EER, VK & VS)",
        "• Greece, EU/EEA & UK (GDPR / Law 4624/2019 / UK GDPR): You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, data portability, object, withdraw consent at any time, and lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority—including the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (HDPA, www.dpa.gr) or the UK ICO.\n• United States (California CCPA/CPRA & State Privacy Laws — VA, CO, CT, UT, TX, etc.): US residents have the right to know/access personal information collected, request deletion, request correction of inaccurate data, obtain a portable copy, and receive non-discriminatory treatment when exercising privacy rights. Finsay DOES NOT \"sell\" personal information and DOES NOT \"share\" personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising. Sensitive personal information is used strictly as necessary to provide requested app features.\n• Exercising Rights: Use in-app tools or email support@finsayapp.com; we verify and respond within 30 days (or the statutory period under applicable law)." to "• EU/EER & VK (AVG): recht op inzage, rectificatie, wissing, beperking, overdraagbaarheid, bezwaar, intrekken toestemming en klacht bij toezichthouder (Autoriteit Persoonsgegevens / HDPA www.dpa.gr).\n• VS (CCPA/CPRA e.a.): recht op inzage, verwijdering, correctie en portabiliteit zonder discriminatie.\n• Uitoefenen: in de app of via support@finsayapp.com (reactie binnen 30 dagen).",
        "10. Children's Privacy (COPPA & GDPR Art. 8) & Changes" to "10. Privacy van kinderen & wijzigingen",
        "• Children's Privacy: Finsay is not intended for children under 13 years of age (US COPPA) or under 16 years of age (or the applicable digital consent age in your EU/EEA/UK country under GDPR Art. 8). We do not knowingly collect data from children; contact support@finsayapp.com for immediate deletion if you believe a child provided data.\n• Policy Updates: We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect new features or legal requirements. Material changes will be notified in-app or on finsayapp.com." to "• Kinderen: Finsay is niet bedoeld voor kinderen onder 13 jaar (COPPA) of 16 jaar in de EU/EER (of lokale minimumleeftijd). Mail support@finsayapp.com voor directe verwijdering.\n• Wijzigingen: belangrijke updates melden we in de app of op finsayapp.com.",
        "1. Acceptance of Terms & Eligibility (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Akkoord & geschiktheid (Bijgewerkt: november 2026)",
        "By downloading, installing, registering for, or using Finsay (finsayapp.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. You must be at least 16 years old in the EU/EEA/UK (or the applicable legal digital consent age in your jurisdiction) and at least 13 years old in the United States (or have verifiable parental consent where required) to use Finsay. If you do not agree, do not use the application." to "Door Finsay (finsayapp.com) te downloaden of te gebruiken ga je akkoord met deze Voorwaarden en ons Privacybeleid. Je moet minstens 16 jaar zijn in de EU/EER/VK (of de wettelijke leeftijd ter plaatse) en 13 jaar in de VS. Ga je niet akkoord, gebruik de app dan niet.",
        "2. Service Description & Strict Financial / Tax Advice Disclaimer" to "2. Dienstbeschrijving & geen financieel/fiscaal advies",
        "Finsay is an informational personal and household expense, income, budget, multi-currency, and split-tracking tool. Finsay DOES NOT provide financial, investment, banking, accounting, legal, or tax advice, nor does it execute payments, currency conversions, or money transfers. Displayed currencies are purely organizational labels; Finsay does not perform regulated foreign-exchange brokerage. You remain solely responsible for verifying all figures, tax obligations, and financial decisions." to "Finsay is een informatief hulpmiddel voor uitgaven, inkomsten, budgetten en verdelingen. Finsay geeft geen financieel, fiscaal of juridisch advies en voert geen betalingen of valutawissels uit. Je blijft zelf verantwoordelijk voor controle van alle bedragen.",
        "3. Bank Notification Reader Disclaimer (No Open Banking / PSD2)" to "3. Disclaimer bankmelding-lezer (Geen Open Banking / PSD2)",
        "• Independent Local Utility: The optional Bank Notification Auto-Catcher reads Android payment notifications solely on-device after your explicit system authorization. Finsay is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any bank, card issuer, or payment institution, and does NOT operate as a PSD2 / Open Banking Account Information Service Provider (AISP) or Payment Initiation Service Provider (PISP).\n• Best-Effort Accuracy: Because banks frequently change notification wording and Android battery/OEM policies may delay or restrict background delivery, Finsay cannot guarantee that every card payment will be detected or parsed with 100% accuracy. You must review and confirm every draft before saving and rely on official bank statements for authoritative records." to "• Onafhankelijke lokale functie: leest meldingen enkel lokaal na jouw toestemming. Finsay is niet verbonden aan banken en biedt geen PSD2 / Open Banking.\n• Controle vereist: controleer elk concept vóór opslaan en raadpleeg altijd je officiële bankafschriften.",
        "4. Receipt OCR, AADE / e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. Bonnen-OCR, AADE QR & spraakinvoer",
        "Optical character recognition (OCR), QR receipt lookups (including direct read-only queries to allowlisted Greek tax/e-invoicing portals such as AADE), and voice-to-text parsing are automated convenience features that may occasionally misread text, speech, dates, or totals. Finsay is not affiliated with AADE or any e-invoicing provider. You are solely responsible for checking and correcting auto-filled values against original receipts before saving." to "OCR, QR-uitlezing en spraakherkenning zijn hulpmiddelen die soms fouten kunnen maken. Finsay is niet verbonden aan AADE. Controleer altijd de ingevulde gegevens vóór opslaan.",
        "5. Shared Households, Member Roles & Third-Party Consent" to "5. Gedeelde boeken, rollen & toestemming van derden",
        "When creating or participating in a shared ledger (Creator, Editor, Registar), you acknowledge that financial entries, split balances, and ledger activity logs are visible to all authorized members of that ledger according to their roles. You represent and warrant that you have obtained appropriate consent before entering another individual's personal information or inviting them to a shared ledger, and you are responsible for managing member access in ledgers you control." to "Bij deelname aan een gedeeld boek (Maker, Redacteur, Invoerder) erken je dat boekingen, saldi en logboeken zichtbaar zijn voor gemachtigde leden en garandeer je toestemming te hebben van uitgenodigde personen.",
        "6. Account Security, Optional App Lock & Data Exports" to "6. Accountbeveiliging, app-slot & exports",
        "• Credentials & Local App Lock: You are responsible for safeguarding your sign-in credentials and device. Optional Biometric/PIN App Lock is a local convenience safeguard; if you forget your PIN or lose device biometric access, recovery may require re-authentication or reinstalling the app.\n• Exported Files: When you export reports (Excel, PDF, CSV) and share them via third-party apps (email, messaging, cloud drives), those exported copies leave Finsay's control and their confidentiality becomes your sole responsibility." to "• Inloggegevens & slot: bescherm je gegevens en toestel. Bij vergeten pincode kan opnieuw inloggen of herinstalleren nodig zijn.\n• Geëxporteerde bestanden: de vertrouwelijkheid van gedeelde Excel-, PDF- of CSV-bestanden valt onder jouw verantwoordelijkheid.",
        "7. Finsay Pro Subscriptions, Renewals & Refunds (Google Play)" to "7. Finsay Pro-abonnementen, verlenging & restitutie",
        "• Billing & Auto-Renewal: Certain advanced features (such as Bank Notification Auto-Catcher, multiple ledgers, and unlimited members) require a Finsay Pro subscription or lifetime purchase processed exclusively via Google Play Billing. Recurring subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled in Google Play settings before the end of the current billing period.\n• Refunds & Consumer Rights: Pricing, cancellations, and refund requests are governed by Google Play's billing policies and applicable mandatory consumer laws in your jurisdiction (including statutory EU/UK withdrawal rights where applicable and US consumer statutes)." to "• Facturering: geavanceerde functies vereisen Finsay Pro via Google Play Billing. Abonnementen verlengen automatisch tenzij tijdig opgezegd in Google Play.\n• Restitutie: volgens Google Play-beleid en dwingend consumentenrecht.",
        "8. Acceptable Use & Intellectual Property" to "8. Aanvaardbaar gebruik & intellectueel eigendom",
        "You agree not to misuse Finsay, bypass authentication or security rules, attempt unauthorized access to other users' data, reverse-engineer or copy proprietary components except as permitted by mandatory law, or use the app for fraudulent or unlawful purposes. All Finsay trademarks, branding, design, and software remain the intellectual property of Finsay and its creators." to "Je stemt ermee in Finsay niet te misbruiken, beveiliging niet te omzeilen, geen ongeoorloofde toegang te zoeken en de software niet te kopiëren. Merken, ontwerp en code blijven eigendom van Finsay.",
        "9. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability" to "9. Uitsluiting garanties & beperking aansprakelijkheid",
        "To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finsay is provided \"AS IS\" and \"AS AVAILABLE\" without warranties of uninterrupted operation or error-free parsing. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Finsay and its developers shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, punitive, or consequential damages, missed bill reminders, unparsed notifications, or loss of profits/data; aggregate liability shall not exceed the total amount paid by you for Finsay Pro during the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.\n• Statutory Carve-Out (EU/UK/US): Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded under mandatory law (including gross negligence, willful misconduct, fraud, or mandatory statutory consumer rights in the EU/EEA, UK, or US states)." to "Voor zover wettelijk toegestaan wordt Finsay geleverd \"ZOALS HET IS\" zonder garantie op foutloze werking. Totale aansprakelijkheid is beperkt tot het bedrag dat je in de afgelopen 12 maanden voor Finsay Pro betaalde, onverminderd dwingende consumentenrechten (EU/EER, VK, VS).",
        "10. Termination, Changes, Governing Law & International Consumer Rights" to "10. Beëindiging, wijzigingen & toepasselijk recht",
        "• Termination: You may terminate your account anytime via Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account. We may suspend accounts that materially violate these Terms or threaten platform security.\n• Governing Law & Consumer Carve-Out: These Terms are governed by the laws of the Hellenic Republic (Greece) and applicable European Union law, with disputes submitted to the courts of Athens, Greece. However, if you are a consumer residing in the EU/EEA, the UK, or the United States, nothing in these Terms deprives you of the mandatory consumer protection laws or statutory forum rights of your country or state of residence.\n• Contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "• Beëindiging: sluit je account via Menu (☰) > Profiel > Account verwijderen.\n• Toepasselijk recht: Grieks en EU-recht (rechtbank Athene), onverminderd de dwingende consumentenbescherming in jouw woonland.\n• Contact: support@finsayapp.com."
    )
}
